# MyEnv Clink Readline Configuration
# Dual Navigation System for CMD:
# - Up / Down Arrows (↑ / ↓): History Search Backward / Forward (سجل الأوامر)
# - Right / Left Arrows (→ / ←) & Tab: Path & File Completion (التحرك في المسار والقبول)

# 1. Up & Down Arrows -> History Search Backward / Forward matching typed prefix
"\e[A": history-search-backward
"\e[B": history-search-forward

# 2. Right Arrow -> Accept Suggestion & Move Forward in Path
"\e[C": clink-accept-suggestion

# 3. Tab -> Interactive File & Path Completion Menu
"\t": clink-completion-popup

# 4. Ctrl+Space / Shift+Tab / F7 -> Interactive History Menu
"\C-@": clink-popup-history
"Control-space": clink-popup-history
"\e[Z": clink-popup-history
"\C-r": clink-popup-history
